# smtp_auth_username in monitoring/prometheus/values.yaml is an AWS Access Key
# ID (AKIA...) used as the SES SMTP username. An access key ID is an
# identifier, not a credential — the paired secret key lives only in the
# alertmanager-ses-smtp Kubernetes Secret (created at bootstrap from SSM/.env,
# never in Git), and the IAM user behind it can do nothing but ses:SendRawEmail.
aws-access-key-id
